From 6b554083b36fa9efc84f80cfb23fb69db072f1fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:40:01 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): bound live notice custody independently of
 admission [daveey]

Release stale same-holder claims on periodic recovery and before admission, using monotonic age. Fence expiry against fresh reclaims and preserve transcript event-key dedup.

Proof: 61 focused tests pass on hub; real admission-hold and sole-claimer regressions fail on baseline. Independent review approved after fresh-reclaim race regression. Mutation testing kills 52/53 valid mutants; remaining prune SQL predicate mutation is equivalent.
